# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
#
#  HOW TO USE:
#  1. Copy this file:  cp .env.example .env
#  2. Fill in real values in .env
#  3. Never commit .env to git (it's in .gitignore)
#
#  WHY THIS PATTERN?
#  .env.example is committed → your team knows what vars are needed.
#  .env is gitignored        → your secrets stay off GitHub.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

